- use TeamOS to violate applicable law.

3. Linux and third-party components

TeamOS is designed to use the Linux kernel and other Linux ecosystem components.
Those components keep their own licenses. This license only covers TeamOS files
that are created by TeamOS contributors and does not replace the license of the
Linux kernel, drivers, firmware, tools, libraries, or other third-party code.

When TeamOS imports or builds Linux components, the applicable Linux and
